 C-&gt;&gt;S: GET /api/users (Authorization: Bearer eyJhbG...)\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: 解析并验证 JWT\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: 200 用户数据</pre><p>JWT 结构分为三部分：Header（算法声明）、Payload（用户信息和过期时间）、Signature（防篡改签名）。Token 有效期一般设为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，配合 Refresh Token 机制实现无感续期。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"public String generateToken(UserDetails user) {&#10;    return Jwts.builder()&#10;        .setSubject(user.getUsername())&#10;        .claim(&quot;roles&quot;, user.getAuthorities())&#10;        .setIssuedAt(new Date())&#10;        .setExpiration(new Date(System.currentTimeMillis() + 7200000))&#10;        .signWith(secretKey, SignatureAlgorithm.HS256)&#10;        .compact();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> String </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">generateToken</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(UserDetails user) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Jwts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">builder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4