    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">signWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(secretKey, SignatureAlgorithm.HS256)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"swagger-openapi-文档\">Swagger/OpenAPI 文档</h3><p>SpringDoc（OpenAPI 3.0）自动扫描控制器注解生成交互式 API 文档：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"@Operation(summary = &quot;创建用户&quot;, description = &quot;注册新用户并返回用户信息&quot;)&#10;@ApiResponses({&#10;    @ApiResponse(responseCode = &quot;200&quot;, description = &quot;创建成功&quot;),&#10;    @ApiResponse(responseCode = &quot;400&quot;, description = &quot;参数校验失败&quot;)&#10;})&#10;@PostMapping&#10;public ApiResponse&lt;UserVO&gt; createUser(@RequestBody @Validated CreateUserDTO dto) {&#10;    // ...&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Operation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">summary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"创建用户\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"注册新用户并返回用户信息\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ApiResponses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ApiResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">responseCode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"200\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"创建成功\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ApiResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">responseCode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"400\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"参数校验失败\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PostMapping</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ApiResponse</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">UserVO</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RequestBody</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Validated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CreateUserDTO dto) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>访问 <code>/swagger-ui.html</code> 即可在线调试接口，前后端团队通过 Swagger 文档对齐接口契约。</p>\n<h3 id=\"接口安全\">接口安全</h3><p>除 JWT 认证外，API 安全还需关注：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CORS 配置</strong>：限制允许的 Origin，避免跨域攻击</li>\n<li><strong>限流（Rate Limiting）</strong>：使用令牌桶或滑动窗口算法，防止接口被刷</li>\n<li><strong>SQL 注入防护</strong>：始终使用参数化查询（MyBatis <code>#{}</code> 而非 <code>${}</code>）</li>\n<li><strong>XSS 防护</strong>：对用户输入的 HTML 内容进行转义</li>\n<li><strong>HTTPS</strong>：生产环境强制 TLS 加密传输</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Spring Boot 3.3+</strong>：基于 GraalVM 的 AOT 编译让启动时间从秒级降至毫秒级，适配 Serverless 部署场景</li>\n<li><strong>GraphQL 与 BFF</strong>：部分场景中 GraphQL 替代 REST 实现更灵活的数据查询，但 REST 仍是主流</li>\n<li><strong>API Gateway</strong>：Spring Cloud Gateway 或 APISIX 在微服务架构中统一处理认证、限流、灰度等横切关注点</li>\n<li><strong>AI 辅助 API 开发</strong>：Copilot 可根据 OpenAPI spec 自动生成 Controller/Service/DTO 代码骨架</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>设计并实现一个图书管理系统的 RESTful API（图书 CRUD + 借阅/归还），要求：统一响应格式、参数校验、全局异常处理、分页查询。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为上述系统添加 JWT 认证：区分管理员和普通用户角色，管理员可增删图书，普通用户只能查看和借阅。实现 Token 刷新机制。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>使用 JMeter 对登录接口进行压力测试，观察在 100 并发下的响应时间和错误率。分析瓶颈并提出优化方案。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>后端 API 开发是全栈能力的核心环节，它将业务逻辑暴露为标准化的 HTTP 接口供前端和移动端消费。RESTful 设计保证接口的一致性和可理解性，JWT 实现轻量级安全认证，Swagger 自动化文档桥接前后端协作，参数校验和异常处理则筑牢了系统的健壮性防线。这些规范和实践在企业级项目中每天都在使用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"后端 API 开发","id":"后端-api-开发"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"RESTful API 设计原则","id":"restful-api-设计原则"},{"level":3,"text":"Spring Boot 控制器与参数校验","id":"spring-boot-控制器与参数校验"},{"level":3,"text":"JWT 无状态认证","id":"jwt-无状态认证"},{"level":3,"text":"Swagger/OpenAPI 文档","id":"swagger-openapi-文档"},{"level":3,"text":"接口安全","id":"接口安全"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"前端开发","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/web-fullstack/frontend-development"},"next":{"title":"移动应用开发","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/web-fullstack/mobile-app-development"}}